  "about": {
    "title": "Ibyerekeye",
    "paragraphOne": "MyStudioTV231 ni urubuga rw'ibiro by'ibitangazamakuru rwifashisha itangazamakuru rya YouTube. Abanyamakuru bacu babika ingingo, amafoto n'amanimero bivuye mu Rwanda n'ahandi.",
